    <scripts />
    <show_scrollbar>false</show_scrollbar>
    <text>The following configuration sets a 1 Hz clock on the terminal 15. Routes the terminal 15 to the external terminal PF1. This example also configures the timestamping for the terminal 15 and PF2 respectively
1st - Connect the PFI1 to PF2 terminal using an SMB cable.
2nd - Device-STM -&gt; ON

3rd - Configure a 1Hz clock on the terminal 15:
	- Enable: enable
	- ModeSet: CLK
	- Period: 1,000,000,000 ns
	- Duty cycle: 500,000,000 ns

4th - Route the TR15 to PF1:
	- TermSrc: 15
	- TermDst: 1
	- Set Terminal

5th - Device STM -&gt; RUNNING
</text>
    <tooltip></tooltip>
    <transparent>true</transparent>
    <vertical_alignment>0</vertical_alignment>
    <visible>true</visible>
